    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, As amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:-",
